From 708bb7b5df606ebd2510a0115524ec12bb07f506 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roqqit <roqqit@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 24 Jun 2024 17:41:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Unbreak avalanche tests

uint32_t is too small to hold proof scores, so use uint64_t instead.

Current-ABC adaptation of a06e1c4c831a6f0bbd9b1e3983a0c6b8d4c4594a: preserve current clamped stake aggregation and APIs, extend Score through newer stake contender ranking/cache, and use bounded proof fixtures. Incorporate the independently demonstrated b93a27e27990bfff202a3b7820f878bf0abe2187 overflow correction: divide by satoshis per hundredth coin before conversion, with independent large-Dogecoin and rounding regressions. This optional coordination arithmetic does not change Dogecoin PoW consensus or require enabling Avalanche.

